    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/805dc232b9d03686b66296a77fdbc7eb.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/805dc232b9d03686b66296a77fdbc7eb.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Fat Cat wants his rent and the only way to get it is deep in the mines. In this 2D sidescrolling strategy/resource management game, excavate and traverse your underground mine shafts to retrieve gold! Go into the mines and extract as much gold as you can. Setup your operation and reinvest your earnings into better gear and equipment to mine more gold and win the game! This line of work not only separates the gold from the dirt, but the pups from the dogs. With danger lurking in these ancient grounds, hungry Dinos awaken, searching for prey and loot. The wise miner doesn\u2019t fear the Dino but sees it\u2019s flesh and bones as a potential fuel source for their operations. Gold mining is a treasure hunt, so open your miner\u2019s map, test some dirt, and find that stash of gold!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7ee5382d42b4f0d383bf0e05c9564949.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7ee5382d42b4f0d383bf0e05c9564949.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7ee5382d42b4f0d383bf0e05c9564949.mp4?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR TASK</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pan Dirt </li><li>Mine Gold</li><li>Smelt Coins</li><li>Make Rent</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/50528f35371cfa3e202771392dce4470.avif?t=1666996290\" /></div><br>Dogs like to move it. You name it they'll carry it for you.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ore</li><li>Gold Rich Dirt</li><li>Coins</li><li>Puppies</li><li>Flamables</li><li>Dino Prisoners</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/f0c7c2f75601ad60f529923be124908a.avif?t=1666996290\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7d30c6163ebbda31afeaafc41ac32973.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7d30c6163ebbda31afeaafc41ac32973.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/7d30c6163ebbda31afeaafc41ac32973.mp4?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Family</li><li>Resources</li><li>House</li><li>Mine Shaft</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beware of Dinos</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/eeb4b141248c42a23b2e914fa481c16b.avif?t=1666996290\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Routes</li><li>Family Business</li><li>Finances</li><li>Time</li><li>Resources</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rent is due at the end of every month</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/4c8a514f1c2f57881e2a2a7e2276275b.poster.avif?t=1666996290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642420/extras/4c8a514f1c2f57881e2a2a7e2276275b.webm?t=1666996290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Bring dirt with gold in it to the surface. Wash away the dirt, then forge the remaining gold nuggets into coins to pay for your rent.",
